summary: 'The app-independent half of the Expo field-test pre-run critical path is complete and committed. The LLM-judge is built and security-cleared (21d95b25/a92bfd21/346c9cf8), and both engine pre-fixes it will measure have landed (58cb76e9): Fix B ripple-gate kills the measured 3/3 over-block false-KNOTs while preserving genuine KNOTs (one pure function in predict, zero determinism cost), Fix A surfaces the Tier-0 invariant false-CLEAN as a disclaimer-on-every-independent-CLEAN with no gate (the canonical case stays undetectable-by-meaning and bounded by the oracle/judge). Full suite 1071 passing. Protocol locked (TD-154). What remains before a live run is increasingly app-coupled: the field-test runner driver, the frozen behavioral smoke oracle''s app-specific assertions, the seeded controls, the Expo backlog with overlap zones, and the run itself.'
